{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>VividCut 是一款結合拼貼與修圖的相片工具，讓 iPhone 及 iPad 用戶把多張照片組合成拼貼作品，同時進行專業級編輯，適合喜歡自製拼貼、整理相片或為社交平台製作圖片的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>拼貼與修圖一站完成</h2>\n<p>VividCut 可一次組合最多 30 張相片，提供網格模板與心形、星形、六邊形等分割版面，相片可從相簿、Files app 或相機匯入，完成後直接分享及匯出。編輯工具涵蓋曝光、對比、飽和度、HSL 與 RGB 曲線，另有超過 50 款濾鏡、AI 一鍵主體遮罩、筆刷修飾、貼紙文字及繪圖功能。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-450-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-451-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-452-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-16-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2778x1284bb-17-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：VividCut</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T14:58:41.507781+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}